      "id": "2026-11-02-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "football",
      "title_zh": "楼下的饭店",
      "title_en": "The restaurant downstairs",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "家", "楼下", "有", "一", "个", "饭店", "。", "那里", "有", "一", "个", "大", "电视", "，", "常常", "有", "很", "多", "人", "在", "那里", "看", "球", "。"],
        ["今天", "晚上", "有", "曼联", "的", "球", "。", "我", "和", "朋友", "一边", "吃", "面包", "，", "一边", "看", "。"],
        ["曼联", "进", "了", "两", "个", "球", "！", "那里", "的", "人", "都", "站", "起来", "了", "。"],
        ["一", "个", "在", "那里", "工作", "的", "人", "说", "：", "“", "今天", "的", "面包", "不", "要", "钱", "！", "”", "我们", "都", "很", "高兴", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "There's a restaurant downstairs from my flat. It has a big TV, and lots of people often watch football there.",
        "Man United were playing tonight. My friend and I ate bread while we watched.",
        "Man United scored two goals! Everyone there jumped to their feet.",
        "Someone who works there said: “The bread is free tonight!” We were all really happy."
      ],
      "names": ["曼联"],
      "new_words": ["楼下", "饭店", "面包"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "楼下", "english": "downstairs" },
        { "word": "饭店", "english": "restaurant" },
        { "word": "面包", "english": "bread" },
        { "word": "曼联", "english": "Manchester United" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-02-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "business & finance",
      "title_zh": "网上还是商场？",
      "title_en": "Online or the shopping centre?",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "常常", "去", "商场", "买", "东西", "。", "现在", "，", "我", "也", "常常", "上网", "买", "。"],
        ["网上", "的", "东西", "很", "多", "，", "有的", "也", "不", "贵", "。"],
        ["上", "个", "月", "，", "我", "在", "网上", "买", "了", "一", "个", "国外", "的", "包", "。", "包", "很", "好看", "。"],
        ["我", "等", "了", "一", "个", "月", "，", "最后", "包", "到", "了", "。", "这", "一", "个", "月", "我", "都", "在", "等", "。"],
        ["我", "想", "，", "下次", "我", "还是", "去", "商场", "买", "吧", "！"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "I often go shopping at the shopping centre. These days I often buy things online too.",
        "There's loads of stuff online, and some of it isn't expensive.",
        "Last month I bought a bag from abroad online. It's a really nice bag.",
        "I waited a whole month, and in the end it arrived. I spent the entire month waiting.",
        "I think next time I'll just go to the shopping centre!"
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["商场", "上网", "国外"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "商场", "english": "shopping centre" },
        { "word": "上网", "english": "to go online" },
        { "word": "国外", "english": "abroad; from abroad" }
      ]
    }
